label: Portfolio
description: "Represents a portfolio within a fund used to group investments and related legal entities."
documentation: "Within a private equity fund, there are portfolios. A portfolio represents a collection of investments held by the fund. Private equity firms typically manage multiple portfolios within a fund, each comprising a set of investments with common characteristics or objectives. Portfolios can be segmented based on factors such as industry, geographic location, risk profile, or investment stage."
